ConsoleServer Debian packaging policy
=====================================

This package is intended for installation into a SONiC image.

It installs seriald.service but deliberately does not use dh_installsystemd,
and it does not enable or start seriald.service. SONiC installs and enables
its separate console-server.service under sonic.target.

Standalone Linux installation continues to use the repository Makefile and
./console installer.

The maintainer identity and copyright/license text in debian/ should be
updated to the project's official values before release.
